{"parse": {"title": "金纺轮-540003", "pageid": 150149, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"金纺轮\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/ff/Item-540001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"金纺轮\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>金纺轮</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#540003</div></div><hr /><div>使用后可在【于湖中央】征集中进行模拟十连征集，可从3次模拟十连征集中选择1次结果作为最终结果；<br />使用该道具进行模拟十连征集时：<br />每次模拟<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">至少必得1个6星角色</span>，<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">13%</span>的概率获取<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">2个6星</span>；<br />3次模拟中，<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">至少1次模拟</span>产生<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">2个6星</span>的概率为<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">​34.15%</span>；<br />每次模拟产生的角色组合不重复，模拟结果全保存，经最终确认后生效。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">金兔子们曾是庆典的常客，它们自有一套赞赏庆典的传统。如今，你拿回了那叠被它们篡改过名字的邀请函，好在时间充裕，是否改回名字的选择权仍然在你手中。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "金纺轮"}}